VLOOKUP & H-Lookup
3 conditions must be fullfilld before applying V & H lookup
1st Condition- 2 tables - 1 master table (where we will put formula)
                         -  source Table (in which values are stored)
2nd condition- There should be common column between source & master column
3rd Condition - The common column should be the left most column in the source table. Not necessary for Master table.
